  □ Every priority fee: is it high enough to avoid
    validator queue drop under congestion?
  □ Every batch size: within Solana's 1232-byte
    transaction size limit?
  □ Every RPC endpoint rotation: does the Connection
    object get refreshed, or does the stale connection
    continue to use the old endpoint?
  □ knownWallets: is it rebuilt often enough that
    mid-session wallet regeneration doesn't contaminate
    the organic buy volume measurement?
  □ lastTradeTs initialisation: does it prevent the
    first-poll false-trigger on page reload?

PERFORMANCE & SCALABILITY
  □ Every loop over wallets × something else — is it
    O(N) or O(N²)? At 5000 wallets O(N²) is catastrophic.
  □ Every getLaunches() call — is it going through the
    cache, or firing a fresh read on every poll tick?
  □ Every querySelector inside a hot loop — can it be
    hoisted or replaced with a Map lookup?
  □ chartData: does it grow without bound? Is it cleared
    when a token card is removed?
  □ _pollInflight: does it use delete (removes the key)
    or = false (accumulates dead keys forever)?
  □ Event listeners: are they added with { passive: true }
    where they don't call preventDefault?

MOBILE / PWA
  □ Does every touch interaction work without hover?
  □ Does the sidebar open/close correctly on mobile?
  □ Does the bottom nav correctly sync with sidebar state?
  □ Are all font sizes, tap targets, and spacing
    comfortable on a 375px screen?
  □ Does the SW register and serve assets correctly
    in standalone PWA mode?
  □ Does the app recover from background kill and
    re-open without a blank screen?

