SYSTEMS THAT MUST WORK  (zero-tolerance)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

CAPITAL FLOWS
  · Launch buy: correct SOL amount, correct mint address, authority
    revocations applied, BudgetLedger.recordSpend() called.
  · Bundle funding: correct per-wallet amount, correct batch count,
    confirmed count matches actual funded wallets (not intended).
  · SOL recirculation: recirculateSol() sells holders → SOL stays in
    bundle wallets → _safeRedistribute tops up from dev wallet.
  · Sweep: 9s confirmation buffer → all bundle wallets → fee floor
    20000 lamports → remainder transferred to dev → sol-swept emitted.
  · Budget: BudgetLedger spend tracked correctly, no phantom spend,
    no over-spend, no zero-total on cold resume.

TRADING ENGINE
  · Every buy uniquely parameterised: amount (5–79% of balance),
    slippage (5-50%), fee tier (0-4), timing (5-10s jittered).
  · Every sell uniquely parameterised: pct (12-100%), same fee/slip.
  · Anti-repetition: all four buffers window < hash space; fallbacks
    register; no buffer permanently saturates.
  · Pacing: nominalDelay pre-calculated so targets hit at steady rate
    from trade #1; remaining-time÷remaining-trades formula correct.
  · Trading: 24/7, every 5-10s, only stops on trigger or stop().
  · Deadline: expiry does NOT stop trading (MUST NOT). It zeroes
    _absoluteDeadline so _tradeDelay() switches to no-deadline mode.
  · Recirculation: fires every 8 cycles; respects triggerFired flag;
    _safeRedistribute called at most once per cycle.

TRIGGER AND SELL
  · Organic trigger: uses raw on-chain td.mc (not floor-clamped state.mc)
    for organicMC calculation. Uses `??` (not `||`) for exitPercentage.
    Clamped to [0,100] before reaching executeSellAll.
  · No double-fire: _sellInProgress Set checked before TradingEngine.stop().
  · Sell loop: _hasTokens check before attempting each wallet.
    Partial failure tolerated; errors logged, sweep still fires.
  · Sweep: fires after sell loop completes + 9s delay.
    swept field in auto-sell-complete reflects whether sweep ACTUALLY ran.
  · UI: onAutoSellFailed clears cache AND calls refreshTokensView().

TARGETS AND FLOOR
  · MC floor locked the moment allTargetsHit transitions to true.
  · allTargetsHit, mcFloor, and baseMC all persisted to storage
    at the moment of first target hit.
  · Floor defense: mc-pace emitted when raw MC drops > 5% below floor.
  · Floor never released. Deadline expiry does not release it.
  · Post-floor urgency scales with floor gap, not fixed at 2.5.

SESSION RESUME
  · launchTime present → use it as deadline base.
  · launchTime absent → use params.id (= _launchStartTs since v1).
  · Neither present → use Date.now() (new session, no deadline drift).
  · _allDeps declared OUTSIDE try{} block. (r61-1 — most critical)
  · 'selling' reset to 'active' on cold reload ONLY, not mid-session.
  · BudgetLedger.init() called with max budget before engines restart.
  · Blob URLs stripped before processing. (r48-4)
  · lastTradeTs initialized to Date.now()-5000 (not 0) to prevent
    first-poll false trigger.

